# The plain integer sort, asked for by name and then actually needed: the gaps
# between neighbours of the sorted list. Nothing here can be substituted away,
# so this is the cost of the sort the compiler emits.
Cursed Energy: stdin
Cursed Technique: Split Text by "\n"
Channeled Energy: Convert List to Integers
Domain Expansion: Quicksort, Descending
Cursed Technique: Pairs
Maximum Technique: Count Matching
    Using: (p) -> item(p, 0) - item(p, 1) = 0
Reveal: stdout
